    "created_at": "2021-05-23T05:46:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-23T05:46:59Z",
    "body": "The way directory.substitutions works atm is literally just string substitution. It's not optimal but you could just add uppercase and lowercase versions of the substitutions in your config. The easiest way to fix is would be to make substitutions case insensitive on Windows. Making to based in inodes could break backwards compatibility but should also be doable. ",
